<newsitem itemid="756564" id="root" date="1997-07-25" xml:lang="en">
<title>POLAND: Kety Q2 net rises to PLN 6.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Kety Q2 net rises to PLN 6.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kety preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     8.67   vs    8.19</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 9.38   vs   10.83</p>
<p>    net profit			     6.77   vs    6.57</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Zaklad Metali Lekkich Kety SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			    121.28   vs   93.92</p>
<p>    costs of sales			88.15   vs   67.75</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.12   vs    0.01</p>
<p>    income tax			     2.73   vs    4.26</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   2.73   vs    6.96</p>
<p>    financial costs			2.14   vs    4.33</p>
<p>    investment			     2.52   vs    3.30</p>
<p>					     H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		    20.67   vs   20.52</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			20.90   vs   24.75</p>
<p>    net profit			    15.03   vs   14.71</p>
<p>    net sales			    222.88   vs  185.26</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     177.62   vs  146.88</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.01   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     6.00   vs   10.04</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   4.53   vs    9.72</p>
<p>    financial costs			4.28   vs    5.48</p>
<p>    investment			     4.93   vs    3.66</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
